```
grid = copy of board
safe = grid of false
stack = all border cells containing 'O'
mark those border cells safe

while stack is not empty:
    r, c = pop
    for each orthogonal neighbor inside the grid:
        if grid[nr][nc] == 'O' and not safe[nr][nc]:
            safe[nr][nc] = true
            push (nr, nc)

for every cell:
    if grid[r][c] == 'O' and not safe[r][c]:
        grid[r][c] = 'X'
return grid
```
